<template><div><h1 id="wiki_key_features">Key Features</h1><section><h2 id="details-setup">Reconnect the spawn sides and turn on power</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-setup-1" data-guide-step>Identify your spawn: Jugger-Nog is on one side, Quick Revive on the other. In co-op the team can begin separated. Follow your side’s doors upstairs rather than waiting for the dividing door to open.</li>
<li id="guide-step-setup-2" data-guide-step>Continue around the upper asylum to the power room and activate the switch. Power opens the central connection and enables perk machines and electric traps. Reunite before trying the timed doll hunt.</li>
<li id="guide-step-setup-3" data-guide-step>Use the Mystery Box for weapons, including the Wunderwaffe DG-2 in Chronicles, and Wunderfizz for additional perks. Traps can clear a corridor but also hurt you; leave a safe way around. There is no normal Pack-a-Punch unlock.</li></ol></section>
<h1 id="wiki_side_quests">Side Quests</h1><section><h2 id="details-secrets">Toilet codes and Samantha’s Sorrow</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-secrets-2" data-guide-step>For Lullaby of a Deadman, face the row of three toilets near the power/kitchen route and interact with the leftmost bowl three times. This short music trigger is separate from the Samantha code below.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/chronicles/verruckt/song_ee/toilet.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;left-most toilet&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-secrets-1" data-guide-step>For Samantha, face those same three bowls: flush the rightmost 9 times, centre 3 times, leftmost 5 times. Count registered flushes and wait for the scream confirming the code. Then interact with the new doll on the floor to the left of Wunderfizz.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/chronicles/verruckt/free_max_ammo/sam_doll.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;ground to the left of the Wunderfizz machine&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-secrets-hunt" data-guide-step>Shoot five dolls as they appear one at a time. Each can use any of the ten photographed spots below; nearby music helps identify the active one. If the timer expires and you hear a laugh, return to the starter doll beside Wunderfizz to restart.</li>
<li id="guide-step-secrets-reward" data-guide-step>Return to the now-standing starter doll beside Wunderfizz and interact again. Collect the Max Ammo and listen to Samantha’s Sorrow.</li></ol><InlineTool tool="bo3-verruckt-dolls" /></section>
<section><h2 id="details-atmosphere">Dentist chair and courtyard fountain</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-atmosphere-chair" data-guide-step>Interact near the dentist chair in the Jugger-Nog spawn room to hear its unsettling audio. This is a small environmental secret and does not award equipment.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/chronicles/verruckt/free_max_ammo/dentist.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Juggernog Spawn Room - On the dentist chair&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-atmosphere-fountain" data-guide-step>Look into the central courtyard and shoot the statue at the fountain to see its blood effect. The fountain is also one possible Samantha target location; the effects are separate.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/chronicles/verruckt/free_max_ammo/fountain.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Courtyard - On top of the bloody fountain in the middle of the map&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section><section><h2 id="guide-sources">Sources and review</h2><p>Written for Black Ops III: Zombies Chronicles. Community instructions and illustrated references were cross-checked on 3 October 2026. Gameplay: Activision / Treyarch; photographs and charts: the credited community sources below. Some shared-layout references show the original release; follow the BO3 instructions in the text. Source review and website checks do not replace an in-game playthrough.</p><ul><li><a href="https://www.reddit.com/r/CODZombies/wiki/verruckt/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">r/CODZombies community guide ↗</a></li>
